      "writtenOn": "2020-01-16T08:45:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The channel_eanbled_mask and NPCX_PS2_PSOSIG will be accessed here and in the ps2_int_handler.\nWe have to let line 118 and line 120 (and also line 124 and 125) to be atomic.\nOtherwise, the channel_enabled_mask and NPCX_PS2_PSOSIG may not consistent if preemption occurs during executing these two lines.",
